234:Serving the result, and timing the layer, the rest of the model and the served model under it, are in [evaluation.md](evaluation.md#serving-a-distilled-space).
252:`data.name` and `model.name` are cards under [`src/lsa/assets`](../../src/lsa/assets), and a card carries where the thing is along with everything else about it.
253:A tokenized dataset card names its directory; a model card names a hub repository and a pinned revision, resolved in the running user's own HuggingFace cache.
